                              ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This License was conceived and designed by spidychoipro. The AI-Only
Public License represents an experimental approach to software licensing
that explores the changing relationship between human intention and
machine-generated code in software development.

The core philosophy: in the age of AI, the right to decide WHAT gets built
belongs to humans, the right to write the CODE belongs to AI, and the
responsibility for the RESULT remains with humans.

"AI gets the keyboard. Human keeps the responsibility."

